{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217401","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217401","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621740101:1":{"text":"そんなのおかしすぎるよ！人がたった一カ月で、そんな劇的に変わると思う？","source_cn":"这也太奇怪了吧！人真的能在一个月内发生这么大的变化吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C08098062D2EAE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621740102:1":{"text":"性格が正反対になるってのもあり得ないよな。天才だとしても聞いたことがない。","source_cn":"不可能有人在短时间内变成完全相反的样子，就算是天才也不行啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0C0ADD3945D29BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621740103:1":{"text":"他のことならともかく、音痴が直るのはちょっと……魔法を使っても難しいはず。","source_cn":"别的暂且不说，五音不全是很难改变的，连魔法也做不到这件事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE2A5BC69CA107EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621740104:1":{"text":"もしかして、僕たちが騙されてるんじゃないか？まさかね……ウソをつくような人には見えないし。","source_cn":"难道……难道他是在骗我们？应该不会吧，谁会在这种事情上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB026273BB266D6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621740105:1":{"text":"考えたところで分からないし、もう<style=\"highlight\">図書館</style>に行って、直接聞いちゃいましょうよ。","source_cn":"猜也猜不出结果，我们直接去<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFC55F981C3949C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","v